 "remarks": "Charming cottage in the beach area that seldom comes on the market! Walk to train and convenient to town. Freshly painted throughout with hardwood floors and tile flooring, skylights, vaulted ceilings, new windows with wood shutters and exposed beams. FIREPLACES ARE NOT TO BE USED! Living room with French doors leads to a private patio. Newer energy efficient heating and cooling system. Lawn care and snow removal included. Washer and dryer in the cottage off kitchen. A truly unique opportunity to rent. The preferred rental term for this unfurnished cottage is August 2026 to March 2027 with some flexibility in term. Photos are owner's furnishings and not included. NO PETS AND NO SMOKERS and NO SMOKING ON PREMISES. Enjoy all that Westport has to offer!",
